---
/**
 * Top bar of the mobile frame (DESIGN.md, «Barra superior móvil»): the brand
 * on the left. Its actions (pending movements, search) and the scroll
 * behaviour belong to the tickets of those features. Below the frame
 * breakpoint only; the desktop frame has the sidebar instead.
 */
---

<header
  class="bg-bg frame:hidden sticky inset-bs-0 z-30 flex min-h-[calc(64px+env(safe-area-inset-top,0px))] items-center pe-2 ps-5 pbs-[env(safe-area-inset-top,0px)]"
  data-mobile-app-bar
>
  <p
    class="font-display text-text text-[20px] leading-none font-extrabold tracking-brand"
    aria-label="finanzas"
  >
    finanzas
    <span class="text-accent-text" aria-hidden="true">
      .
    </span>
  </p>
</header>
